{"id":"nachdem","lemma":"nachdem","pos":"conj","rank":500,"glosses":["after (that)","given that, being that"],"ipa":"/naːxˈdeːm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/da/De-nachdem.ogg/De-nachdem.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wir gehen, nachdem wir gegessen haben.","en":"We'll go after we eat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755965","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go, to walk"},null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"to eat","l":"essen"},{"g":"have"}]},{"text":"Wohin kommen wir, nachdem wir sterben?","en":"Where do we go after we die?","words":[{"g":"where to, whither"},{"g":"to come"},{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"to die"}]},{"text":"Er kam, nachdem du gegangen warst.","en":"He came after you left.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755920","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Was ist passiert, nachdem wir gegangen waren?","en":"What happened after we left?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"},null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Nachdem du hier bist, kannst du mir helfen.","en":"Since you're here, you can help me.","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to help"}]}]}